          "type": "story",
          "variant": "split",
          "content": {
            "eyebrow": "Our story",
            "title": "Salads and grain bowls, made for everyday.",
            "description": "Great food should not have to be a project. We believe the fresh, delicious choice should also be the convenient one — which is why every keke menu starts with market greens and warm grains, then builds up from there. Chopped, dressed and finished to order, our bowls are the part of a busy day you actually look forward to.",
            "media": {
              "kind": "image",
              "path": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1505576399279-565b52d4ac71?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=80",
              "alt": "Seasonal garden salad tossed with market vegetables"
            },
            "ingredientsLabel": "In the rotation",
            "ingredients": [
              "Market greens",
              "Warm grains",
              "Roasted vegetables",
              "Fresh herbs",
              "Seed toppings"
            ],
            "promises": [
              "Seasonal by design — the menu follows what is ripening nearby, not the other way around",
              "Honest cooking — dressings, grains and sauces made in-house every morning",
              "Easy on purpose — build your bowl, order ahead and get back to your day"
            ],
            "action": {
              "label": "See what we believe",
              "target": {
                "kind": "page",
                "pageId": "about",
                "fragment": "about-beliefs"
